# Bloodthirsty Conqueror: damage dealt to an opponent causes that opponent to lose life (ruling 2024-11-08), so Bot1 gains
# that much. Lightning Bolt at Bot2 costs Bot2 3 and gains Bot1 3 (20 + 3 = 23). Positive control for the refusal case
# in bloodthirsty-conqueror-gains-nothing-when-its-controller-loses-life.

